    <data key="d0">Accenture Circular Supply Chain Solution on AWS</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Circular supply chain solution leveraging IoT, Hyperledger Fabric on EKS, off-chain DynamoDB, SageMaker analytics, and CloudHSM key management.</data>
